  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Health Organization Core Voluntary Contributions 2022-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will enable the provision of voluntary core contributions to the World Health Organization (WHO) between 2022-2027.  The investment will support WHO to deliver on its overarching mandate, approach, goals and objectives as outlined its Constitution and General Programme of Work.  In addition, this investment will enable Australia to advance the efficient and effective operations of WHO in the Western Pacific Region.</narrative>
  </description>
